SUMMARY:You're a Good Man\, Charlie Brown!
DESCRIPTION:MHU Theatre Arts Department brings an entertaining musical filled with family comedy\, wise cracking characters\, and heart-warming moments. From October 23-25 at Owen Theatre\, a talented cast of theatre arts students is thrilled to share their hard work with you. The musical will be showing at 7:30 PM on Oct. 23\, 2:30 PM and 7:30 PM on Oct. 24\, and 2:30 PM on Oct. 25. Tickets to the show are $15 per person and can be purchased in person from the box office the night of the show or online at mhutheatre.ludus.com. Concessions will be available to purchase at any time before or during the show. All profits from concessions and ticket purchases will proceed to funding the theatre arts program at Mars Hill University for training the next generation of talented actors\, singers\, and tech professionals.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/youre-a-good-man-charlie-brown/
LOCATION:Owen Theatre\, 44 College St\, Mars Hill\, 28754\, United States
CATEGORIES:Academic Events and Lectures,Cultural Events,Featured,Public Events,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.mhu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/feature004.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Theatre Arts Department":MAILTO:boxoffice@mhu.edu
END:VEVENT
