SUMMARY:Football Night
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us for a signature event\, Mars Hill University Football Night. \nThis event will feature a delicious meal\, greetings from Coach Barnette and other football alumni\, exclusive items and memorabilia up for bid during our silent auction\, and raffle items! \nJoin us as we celebrate an impactful year for Mars Hill Football and the Lions Athletic Club. \nDinner tickets: $75 per person \nAll proceeds from Football Night will go to enhance the student-athlete experience at Mars Hill University.
